  "sourceSummary": "Kaiser Permanente Neck Spasm Exercises, Levator scapula stretch: sit in firm chair or stand, tilt head toward one shoulder, turn to look down into that armpit bending slightly forward, relax and use head weight.15-30second hold in source is not the3second demonstration. This source does not require hand overpressure; not combined with CUH hand-on-head/chair-grip variation.",
